{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"de1914f1656c5231eab0d0df357ea37745e7acc1922d60d369f432e6a1e27f17","ja":"今度は妹に","zh":"这次轮到妹妹了","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6e60c0add5bf6eccd99079d8286b7ab3a22303599e5c60586b1723eabac0362d","ja":"お疲れさま、瑞希ちゃん。\n1日お姉ちゃん体験はどうだったかしら？","zh":"辛苦了，瑞希。\n这1天当姐姐的体验感觉如何呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0ff96be665e84f1d076ce46014d4ab23373f7d9c6a06a4788f28e0a586f21a9c","ja":"とても大変でしたが、それ以上に\n楽しかったです。……いい経験ができたぞ。","zh":"虽然非常辛苦，但比这更让人觉得\n开心。……积累了宝贵的经验呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fb148b1bb8a2dbdfe7cee92aac36db708b532d040479693599e73ab4030a809f","ja":"それは何よりです、私も妹として普段と違う\n体験ができ、とても充実した1日でした。","zh":"那真是太好了。作为妹妹，我也体验到了\n不同于平时的事物，度过了非常充实的1天。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"dde1b7125ff644fbafb531c3382d26efff67ab4e8dff05650e23f1dbda225495","ja":"でも、かなり恥ずかしいものもあったわよね。\n妹は姉に甘えるものって思ってたけど……。","zh":"不过，也有挺让人不好意思的事呢。\n我本来以为妹妹就该向姐姐撒娇的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"23f408db11a941634f239ad612622b33f7bc9d0b551c9c16d369c9f81685d8b8","ja":"そうですね。\nそれはやはり、私達が姉だからでしょうか。","zh":"是啊。\n这果然是因为，我们是姐姐吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b26aad8c1dd662004b82d17243e7c6fce9235675f9809c39e7b5630003ee9f3a","ja":"なるほど……妹はまた違った体験が\nできるのですね……興味があるぞ。","zh":"原来如此……妹妹还能有不一样的\n体验啊……真令人感兴趣呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a9fb9705ca8af16eb48ba7783ba747b9e421f4371da8a1e1ae8a775f43d60f86","ja":"えっ！　ちょっと待って、瑞希ちゃん！\n次は私たちの妹になりたいの！？","zh":"诶！等一下，瑞希！\n下次是想当我们的妹妹吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"51d2913f0b6c13469c7845686a34e88efd7a136898b102bd7bcd01c5b8dc509f","ja":"はい……。今度はおふたりに甘えてみたいと……。\nダメでしょうか？","zh":"好的……。这次我也想向两位撒撒娇……\n这样不可以吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d4845ba675a4b5ec556f4b0b032df481ddaccfa1108859b7798cded700a679f0","ja":"もう、しょうがないわね……って、\n言いたいところだけど……。","zh":"真拿你没办法呢……\n虽然很想这么说……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c26688bcf6c8dd02c247a97519b186442994d089b8034f11e58ba30331e93da9","ja":"瑞希ちゃん、その考えは間違えているわよ。","zh":"瑞希，你那个想法不对哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"99140676c091d118bd4664333cf5d6f85853611cab7b0b528a66e3a6397734e9","ja":"ふふっ、そうですね。今更かと。","zh":"呵呵，也是呢。事到如今才说这个。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"6768dda82b417c6594e20e8478d044805b512209a966a2aecae1cbd4d2173d01","ja":"いい、瑞希ちゃん。この劇場にいる子は、\nもうみんな私たちの大切な妹みたいなものなのよ！","zh":"听好了，瑞希。身处这个剧场的孩子们，\n已经全都像是我们珍贵的妹妹一样了哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"04c9dd8dd4027e5a745b483b31ce05876fda4197efb458db7e1a80e9d90e2812","ja":"そういうことです。\nいつでも姉として頼ってください。","zh":"就是这么回事。\n随时都可以把我当成姐姐来依靠哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1313.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9acf528c0faa558d6ead2e52ac076984afa004a1270b9f91fea6a4749bf6f846","ja":"なんと、そうでしたか……ありがとうございます。\nこのみお姉ちゃん、貴音お姉ちゃん……えへへ。","zh":"哎呀，原来是这样吗……谢谢你们。\n木美姐姐、贵音姐姐……嘿嘿。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
